  "docTitle": "Distributed Key-Value Store (Dynamo) - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a Dynamo-style distributed key-value store: consistent hashing with virtual nodes, N/R/W quorums, vector clocks, hinted handoff, Merkle-tree anti-entropy, gossip and LSM storage.",
  "hero": {
