    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Discord</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Distributed Key-Value Store (Dynamo)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Build the store behind Amazon's shopping cart: always writable, spread over hundreds of machines, surviving disks, racks and whole datacenters going away. You will learn every technique in the Dynamo paper's famous Table 1, why each exists, and how DynamoDB later changed course.</p>\n      "
